7432437268820", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_767432440602153_5847822232720520044_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WBlk9MAuDMQQ7kNvwH0Z9Fy&_nc_oc=AdovsACaZ0WqO7WELHAlDHErm32LyTN3_gaZshyAQC1T08a28eTSxd9OttIJ1vF4i1M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTtSWkzf_iqVgF_Rszp_BL83GaJ0FNPu9rK4YjVAJ7qfA&oe=6B0B3163"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videocover..png", "id": "4033990933345146", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974838_4033990936678479_3976172047705502593_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eG-z4ut49UsQ7kNvwEqWWE6&_nc_oc=Ado2BoiZuFJZtqHMUe-65hcOv5qErDN1SKmz7Usio8nqhcpV2zBdevg4f-fSKmxI94E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT5h5VKe5YjD3GeFJ4Hxjm-8ksvCxGkIxstmSOVLfeZVA&oe=6B0B10CE"}, "display_name": "NAKA", "keywords": [], "long_description": "everis NAKA provides customers with eXtended Reality (XR) spaces for configuring immersive experiences to cover a wide variety of use cases:\n\nTraining spaces\nConfigurable focus-intensive trainings performed in safe, controlled 3d realistic models and environments \n\nShowroom and retail spaces\nEngaging and memorable experiences for retail and customer support processes\n\nProcesses and business support spaces\nBusiness-specific connected process for employees, associates and other collaborators (e.g. onboarding, support)\n\nMeetings and collaborative spaces\nMulti-user, VoIP-enabled environment for sharing documents, videos, tasks and much more.", "short_description": "The purpose of everis NAKA is to help top level organizations to provide large-scale engaging immersive experiences either to their customers or to their employees by providing an enterprise-level extended reality platform."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.everisnaka.com/priva